  "referenceNumber": "RUS2942",
  "remarks": "\nJSC PLANT MEZON is an “\ninvolved person\" under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because it is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in sectors of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely: (i) the Russian electronics sector; and (ii)  the Russian defence sector.  \n",
